  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 403.24 Noise Levels of Marine Engines",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 403.24 Noise Levels of Marine Engines. No boat shall be offered for sale or operated in or upon the waters of this state that have engines or motors that exceed the noise levels set forth in RSA 270:37.\n\nSource. #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 403.23); ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
